ui.teamBridge.builtin.general_topic {"role":"channel header topic","tone":"plain, sentence case","length":"One sentence; may truncate.","placeholders":{},"note":"Describes the built-in #general channel: the whole organization, meaning every person who uses Team Bridge plus each person's agent (their chief of staff). Lead with the whole organization so it reads differently from #humans. The agent rule: every agent in the channel sees every message, and replies when @-mentioned or in a thread it follows. Each owner sets their own agent's notify level, so never promise that every agent answers every message, and make no reply-time promise. 'Threads they follow' means the agent follows the thread, not the reader. Nobody can leave the channel, and it cannot be renamed. Keep 'agents' as the product's usual word for AI agents. Use no em dash; use a colon or the language's natural equivalent."}
